  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "年末も近いし、この時期の夜って特に冷え込むだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こうして歩くことも多いしさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201511/2002015110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "というか、それはプロデューサーが謝ることではないですよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201511/2002015110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "お互いに仕事ですし……",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201511/2002015110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それはそうかもしれないんだけどな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "プロデューサーとしてはアイドル第一でいたいというか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201511/2002015110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え、俺なんか変なこと言ったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201511/2002015110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "通常運転だな、と",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201511/2002015110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーがアイドル第一と言うのなら、\r\n私はアイドルとして仕事第一でいるので",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201511/2002015110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なので、私に申し訳ないと感じる必要はないです",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201511/2002015110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2300
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "今日どうかしたんですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201511/2002015110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なんだか少し変ですよね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201511/2002015110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだか最近仕事ばっかりだったな、と思ってさ\r\nもっと灯織の思う通りに時間を使ってもらえたら……って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この冬は一回しかないから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……その言葉、そっくりそのままお返しします",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201511/2002015110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は好きでやってるだけだぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "──それも、そっくりそのままお返しします",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201511/2002015110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015110140,
